    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Protocol 01</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">IBA stands for Indian Brass Association, which is a non-profit organization aimed at regulating the transportation industry.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #10b98122; color: #10b981; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">02</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Protocol 02</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">IBA-approved LR/Bilty ensures that the packer and mover follows industry standards, including safety measures, insurance, and documentation.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<p>To fully protect your belongings during transit, it is essential to opt for comprehensive risk coverage provided by packers and movers. For your move from Nagpur to Bangalore, a 100% declared value IRDAI (Insurance Regulatory and Development Authority of India) marine transit insurance covers your belongings against accidental collision or unforeseen delays during transit.</p>

<ul>
	<li>IRDAI, or Insurance Regulatory and Development Authority of India, is an autonomous regulatory body that oversees the insurance sector in India.</li>
	<li>Marine transit insurance ensures that in case of any unfortunate incidents during transit, you are covered for the full declared value of your belongings.</li>
</ul>

<p>This insurance coverage protects you from potential losses caused due to unforeseen circumstances, providing peace of mind during the moving process.</p>

<h3>Choosing the Right Packers and Movers Company</h3>

<p>When selecting a packers and movers company for your move, consider those that follow the GST rules, provide IBA-approved LR/Bilty, and offer comprehensive risk coverage with IRDAI marine transit insurance.</p>

<ul>
	<li>A reputable packers and movers company will ensure compliance with GST rules and provide necessary paperwork.</li>
	<li>IBA-approved LR/Bilty is an essential document ensuring proper documentation and safety standards.</li>
	<li>Choose a company that provides comprehensive risk coverage with IRDAI marine transit insurance for complete protection of your belongings.</li>
</ul>

